: 1775233279:0;pbcopy <<<EOF\
Global Permission Changes (org/project module level)\
\
Fetcher SA (orchestrator) â€ƒ´ LEAST_PRIVILEGE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS in fetcher.tf\
\
clientauthconfig.clients.listWithSecrets\
âƒ¦ƒ² Replaced with clientauthconfig.clients.list\
Why: Exposes OAuth client secrets org-wide. Listing without secrets is sufficient for CSPM.\
Still available elsewhere? No â€ƒ´ .list replaces it in both ROLE_PERMISSIONS and\
LEAST_PRIVILEGE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS\
\
cloudfunctions.functions.sourceCodeGet\
âƒ¦ƒ² Removed from LEAST_PRIVILEGE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS\
Why: Allows reading Cloud Function source code. Not needed for asset inventory.\
Still available elsewhere? Yes â€ƒ´ still in SERVERLESS_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS (worker role,\
serverless-scanning.tf)\
\
artifactregistry.repositories.downloadArtifacts\
âƒ¦ƒ² Removed from LEAST_PRIVILEGE_ROLE_PERMISSIONS\
Why: Fetcher only needs metadata (list/get). Worker handles actual artifact scanning.\
Still available elsewhere? Yes â€ƒ´ still in REGISTRY_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS (registry-scanning.tf) and\
SERVERLESS_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS (serverless-scanning.tf), both worker roles\
\
Worker SA â€ƒ´ disk_analysis_roles in main.tf\
\
roles/cloudkms.cryptoKeyEncrypterDecrypter\
âƒ¦ƒ² Removed from disk_analysis_roles\
Why: No CMEK-encrypted disks in our environment. This predefined role grants both encrypt and decrypt, which\
is excessive write access.\
Still available elsewhere? No â€ƒ´ fully removed\
\
Worker SA â€ƒ´ Intentionally NOT changed\
\
compute.disks.useReadOnly â€ƒ´ in DISK_ANALYSIS_ROLE_PERMISSIONS (disk-scanning.tf)\
Why kept: Worker needs this to mount disks read-only for scanning on projects we ARE scanning. Original org\
module commented this out, but we keep it â€ƒ´ deny policies protect sensitive projects instead.\
\
compute.images.useReadOnly â€ƒ´ in DISK_ANALYSIS_ROLE_PERMISSIONS (disk-scanning.tf)\
Why kept: Same rationale â€ƒ´ worker needs image read access for active scanning.\
\
New count guards added\
\
- disk_scanning (bool, default false) â€ƒ´ gates disk-scanning.tf role + IAM member by count\
- registry_scanning (bool, default false) â€ƒ´ gates registry-scanning.tf role + IAM member by count\
\
These match the existing pattern used by forensic, serverless_scanning, data_scanning,\
terraform_bucket_scanning, and cloud_events.\
\
---\
Deny Policy Permissions (applied per-project on sensitive projects)\
\
All deny rules target the worker SA (wiz-worker-sa@wiz-outpost-ems5ykf2.iam.gserviceaccount.com) only.\
\
deny_disk_scanning\
Sourced from DISK_ANALYSIS_ROLE_PERMISSIONS in disk-scanning.tf\
\
- compute.googleapis.com/disks.useReadOnly â€ƒ´ Mounting disks read-only for snapshot scanning\
- compute.googleapis.com/images.useReadOnly â€ƒ´ Reading machine images for scanning\
- compute.googleapis.com/snapshots.create â€ƒ´ Creating disk snapshots\
- compute.googleapis.com/snapshots.get â€ƒ´ Reading snapshot metadata\
- compute.googleapis.com/snapshots.list â€ƒ´ Listing available snapshots\
\
deny_registry_scanning\
Sourced from REGISTRY_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS in registry-scanning.tf\
\
- artifactregistry.googleapis.com/repositories.downloadArtifacts â€ƒ´ Downloading container images and artifacts\
from Artifact Registry\
- storage.googleapis.com/objects.get â€ƒ´ Reading storage objects (used by AR for image layers)\
\
deny_data_scanning\
Sourced from DATA_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS in data-scanning.tf\
\
- bigquery.googleapis.com/tables.getData â€ƒ´ Reading BigQuery table data for classification/PII detection\
- bigquery.googleapis.com/jobs.create â€ƒ´ Running BigQuery queries for data analysis\
- cloudsql.googleapis.com/backupRuns.create â€ƒ´ Creating CloudSQL backup snapshots for scanning\
- cloudsql.googleapis.com/backupRuns.delete â€ƒ´ Deleting CloudSQL backups created by Wiz\
- alloydb.googleapis.com/backups.create â€ƒ´ Creating AlloyDB backups for scanning\
- alloydb.googleapis.com/backups.delete â€ƒ´ Deleting AlloyDB backups created by Wiz\
- storage.googleapis.com/objects.get â€ƒ´ Reading storage objects for data classification\
- storage.googleapis.com/objects.list â€ƒ´ Listing storage objects for data inventory\
- storage.googleapis.com/buckets.getObjectInsights â€ƒ´ Creating object inventory reports for metadata analysis\
\
deny_serverless_scanning\
Sourced from SERVERLESS_SCANNING_ROLE_PERMISSIONS in serverless-scanning.tf\
\
- artifactregistry.googleapis.com/repositories.downloadArtifacts â€ƒ´ Downloading serverless function artifacts\
- artifactregistry.googleapis.com/repositories.get â€ƒ´ Reading AR repository metadata for serverless\
- cloudfunctions.googleapis.com/functions.sourceCodeGet â€ƒ´ Downloading Cloud Function source code\
- cloudfunctions.googleapis.com/functions.get â€ƒ´ Reading Cloud Function metadata (includes env vars which may\
contain secrets)\
- run.googleapis.com/revisions.get â€ƒ´ Reading Cloud Run revision details\
- storage.googleapis.com/objects.get â€ƒ´ Reading storage objects (function source bundles)\
- storage.googleapis.com/objects.list â€ƒ´ Listing storage objects\
\
---\
Sensitive projects where deny policies will be applied\
\
- gSC Superblocks (module.gsc_superblocks) â€ƒ´ MNET VPC host, training network, AR + container APIs\
- Training Infra (module.ai_training_infra) â€ƒ´ Proprietary model training, AR + container APIs\
- Data Infra (module.ai_datagen_data_infra) â€ƒ´ Data processing, shared VPC, AR + container APIs\
- Data Workloads (module.ai_datagen_data_workloads) â€ƒ´ Data processing, AR + container APIs\
EOF
